DJI Osmo Pocket 4P: A cinematic journey through Italy & France 🎥

My recent director’s cut for @djiglobal x @auteurstudios. Throughout this two-week journey, we had the privilege to produce and film @djiglobal’s latest launch campaign for their newest Osmo Pocket 4P, it took us to the Amalfi Coast, Florence, and Paris, a journey filled with euphoric scenery, Renaissance, art, history, elegance and romance.

The impressive 17-step dynamic range and D-LOG 2 from the @djiglobal Osmo pocket 4P, it delivers incredible image quality that fits comfortably in your hand and pocket and has the potential to replace larger setups for filmmakers, representing a significant leap forward that could transform the industry.

I’m deeply proud to have been part of this project with @auteurstudio. I hope you guys enjoy this director's cut that I have edited. 

